Package: simcbsradata
Title: Simulate CBS Microdata
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Author", "Name", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "author@example.com")
Description: Generates synthetic CBS microdata with realistic Dutch population
    distributions. Supports multiple CBS datasets (Woonbase and others) via
    YAML-driven config files. Provides a drop-in replacement for
    haven::read_sav() that intercepts registered CBS file names and returns
    simulated data with haven-compatible labelled columns, consistent
    cross-file identifiers, and CBS-calibrated value distributions.
